    "detailed_description": "Story<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere was a legend about a certain isolated island.<br />\r\nIt appears once every 100 years at the top of the island's mountain, and it is said that once you reach it, you will have wealth, fame, and women.<br />\r\nThe hare and the tortoise race to reach that location.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt first, the turtle is disappointed at the battle he cannot win, but<br />\r\nWhile gaining magical powers that appear all over the island.<br />\r\nFollow the rabbit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame System<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl the turtle to reach the pillar of light at the top of the mountain before the rabbit<br />\r\nIn the field, there are items that increase the speed of the turtle and items that cast magic on the rabbit.<br />\r\nThere are items that allow you to fly and items that give you jet output.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake full use of these items and aim for the goal before the rabbit.",
